cuems-common (1.3.0-8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * sudoers/99-cuems-poweroff: fix the systemctl path /sbin/systemctl ->
    /usr/bin/systemctl. /sbin/systemctl does not exist on bookworm (usr-merge),
    so the two `cuems ... /sbin/systemctl poweroff[ --no-block]` entries never
    matched and were dead. The working /sbin/poweroff entry (what the bridge
    actually uses) was unaffected; this only matters if controller_poweroff_cmd
    is set to a systemctl invocation.

